.Dd May 29, 2026
.Dt ZDOTS-OBSERVABILITY 7
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm zdots-observability
.Nd tracing and diagnostics model for zdots
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Zdots uses local JSONL traces, optional OpenTelemetry export, deploy log packs,
and service status probes. Non-OTel diagnostics are intentionally available
when the collector or LGTM stack is down.
.Sh SURFACES
.Bl -tag -width "zdots-log-analyze"
.It Xr zdots-ctl 8
Service and health checks.
.It Xr capabilities 1
Environment contract.
.It Xr zdots-log-analyze 1
Deploy/update diagnostics independent of OTel.
.It Pa ~/.local/state/zsh/traces.jsonl
Local trace stream.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr otel-collector 8 ,
.Xr local-ci 8
